{"request":{"op":"document","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_197541933#0_453275483"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_197541933#0_453275483","document":"How many unarmed black people are killed by police each year? ... How many unarmed black people are killed by police each year? How many unarmed black people are killed by police each year? How many black men have been killed this year? George Floyd What is Blue Lives Matter? The countermovement claims to support local law enforcement, but its supporters have been accused of racism Rayshard Brooks Elijah McClain Eric Garner What is the Black Lives Matter movement? Most read in US News 'KILLER' TEEN NOT BACKING BIDEN BACK ON 'IT'S DAMAGING' SICK HISTORY GAFFE AGAIN  ... How many unarmed black people are killed by police each year? The Sun, A News UK Company Close TOP Sign in US Edition UK Edition Scottish Sun Irish Sun Search Home News Entertainment Lifestyle Sport All Football All Entertainment Celebrity Movies TV 'ONE TOO MANY' How many unarmed black people are killed by police each year? Patrizia Rizzo, SEO Reporter Sep 3 2020, 17:06 ET Updated: Sep 3 2020, 17:15 ET Patrizia Rizzo, SEO Reporter Invalid Date, THE recent spate of police-involved deaths highlight a grim statistic: black Americans are three times more likely to be killed by police than whites. More than 1,000 unarmed people were killed due to police harm between 2013-2019 and one third were black, according to Mapping Police Violence. 16 The deaths of black people relating to police brutality have sparked outrage Credit: AFP Here is more on the grim statistic and the police-related deaths of black people. How many black men have been killed this year? Of the 765 people killed by police in 2020, 28 percent of them have been black people - despite comprising only 13 percent of the US population.","ok":true,"op":"document"}}
