{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_1461561434#8_3028732033","relevance":3,"reason":"The result is a fact-check dedicated to statistics on unarmed people killed by law enforcement and directly cites annual counts, including nine unarmed Black people and nineteen unarmed white people in one year, plus context from Washington Post and Mapping Police Violence databases.","learned":"Fact-checking coverage notes that official/press databases differ in how they classify unarmed victims, toy weapons, unknown armed status, and vehicles, affecting counts of unarmed people killed by police."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1448","reason":"This query is producing database- and fact-check-based counts of unarmed people killed by police, so continue for more grade-3 evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1448"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_07_1575802734#1_2909137772","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1448","rank":2,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_07_1575802734#1_2909137772\" , \"end_char\": 2054.000000 , \"headings\": \"776 People Killed By Police So Far in 2015, 161 Of Them Unarmed 776 People Killed By Police So Far in 2015, 161 Of Them <cover>Unarmed September 01st, 2015 \" , \"segment\": \"The Counted database is the most comprehensive information available on police killings, since no U.S. government agency maintains a similar listing. Police killings in America have sparked a national movement for police reform, especially since the death of Mike Brown last year in Ferguson, Missouri. Based on The Guardian’s statistics, police killed more white people </cover>than any other race this year. A total 385 white people have been killed by police this year, and 66 of them were unarmed at the time of their death. However, activists like the members of the Black Lives Matter movement argue that police kill blacks at a rate disproportionate to their total percentage of the population — an assertion supported by The Guardian’s statistics. Police killed almost five black people per every million black residents "}}
