{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_765406444#4_1480356449","relevance":3,"reason":"This segment is from a statistics-focused article on police violence and directly answers frequency with the key point that police killed 3 people per day last year; it also cites Mapping Police Violence's broad definition of police killing and data sources.","learned":"Mapping Police Violence defines police killings broadly as deaths from being shot, beaten, restrained, intentionally hit by a police vehicle, pepper sprayed, tasered, or otherwise harmed by officers, and says it tracks more than 90% of U.S. killings."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1472","reason":"This query is retrieving Mapping Police Violence-based statistics on police-killing frequency and may yield additional direct evidence beyond the already judged article segment."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1472"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_765406444#3_1480354047","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1472","rank":2,"snippet":"track more than 90% of killings in the U.S., defines a police killing as any time someone dies as a result of “being shot, beaten, restrained, intentionally hit by a police vehicle, pepper sprayed, tasered, or otherwise harmed by police officers, whether on-duty or off-duty.” VIDEO 4:31 04:31 Kansas City Mayor Quinton Lucas on protests and implementing curfew Squawk Alley The data from <cover>Mapping Police Violence is sourced from three databases — killedbypolice.net, fatalencounters.org and the U.S. Police Shootings Database — as well as original research focused on social media, obituaries, criminal records databases, police reports and other sources, according to the group. Three charts below characterize violence attributed to police, while a fourth depicts attacks carried out against police. Police killed 3 people per day </cover>last year Zoom In Icon Arrows pointing outwards American police forces killed three people per day in 2019, for a total of nearly 1,100 killings. Those numbers are far higher than in other wealthy western countries.\" , \"start_char\": 2455.000000 , \"title\": \"George Floyd death: Police violence in the U.S. in 4 charts\" ,"}}
